-- Ordered quest guidance; source 967020b2b8ca645afcaf90d9bbe5a1b64673947d; generated 2026-10-20.
QuestGuidance.Register("en",446,{
[14241]="7001CC62\n1\tFind the fleeing Orcs in the Mirk-eaves cavern\tOrcs fleeing from Dol Guldur have taken refuge in a cavern in the Mirk-eaves. Alfirimbes has asked you to find the fleeing Orcs in the Mirk-eaves cave and to put an end to the threat they pose.\n2\tDefeat pestilent glow-worms in the Hall of Lights (total: 14)\030Defeat the glow-worm queen in the Hall of Lights\tPestilent glow-worms and their queens can be found throughout the Hall of Lights. The fleeing Orcs have been slain by the pestilent glow-worms in the Hall of Lights.\n3\tTalk to Alfirimbes at Echad Sirion\tAlfirimbes is waiting to speak with you in Echad Sirion. You have cleansed the Hall of Lights of the dangerous glow-worm infestation and should return to Alfirimbes with the news.\n",
[14242]="7001CC82\n1\tCollect egg-shells (total: 6)\030Collect glow-worm slime (total: 8)\030Collect aged wine (quantity: see journal)\tGath Ulunn is located behind the walls of the Orc-camp in Gathbúrz. The Hall of Lights, a cavern among the Mirk-eaves, is home to pestilent glow-worms and their queens. The ruins of Agistath, located among the Dourstocks, appear to be the final resting place of aged Audaghaim wine. Barvessain has asked you to bring her egg-shells from the worms of Gath Ulunn, slime from the glow-worms of the Hall of Lights, and aged Audaghaim wine from Agistath.\n2\tBring Barvessain the egg-shells, slime, and Audaghaim wine\tBarvessain is high atop one of the towers in Ost Galadh. You have collected many components for Barvessain and should bring them to her at Ost Galadh.\n",
[14243]="7001CC83\n1\tSeize the Warg-pens of Dol Guldur\030Seize the Sword-hall of Dol Guldur\030Seize the Dungeons of Dol Guldur\tEntrances to the Warg-pens, the Sword-hall, and the Dungeons of Dol Guldur can be found along the rocky spire on which the fortress stands. Braiglinn has asked you to gather a small fellowship of allies and to seize a strategic location in Dol Guldur.\n2\tTalk to Braiglinn at Imlad Lalaith\tBraiglinn is in Imlad Lalaith on the shore of Anduin, in Lothlórien. You have seized a strategic objective in Dol Guldur and should report now to Braiglinn.\n",
[14244]="7001CC84\n1\tDefeat gaunt-men in Agistath (total: 6)\030Find some connexion between Agistath and Audaghaim\tThe ruins of Agistath are located beyond a cave-mouth in the Dourstocks. Cúcheron has asked you to investigate the ruins of Agistath.\n2\tBring broken wooden toy to Cúcheron\tCúcheron is outside the Haunted Inn, in Audaghaim. You have investigated the ruins of Agistath for Cúcheron and should tell him what you found.\n3\tLeave the broken wooden toy at a gravestone in Audaghaim\tGravestones can be found throughout Audaghaim. Cúcheron has asked you to leave the broken wooden toy at one of the gravestones located in Audaghaim.\n4\tTalk to Cúcheron at the Haunted Inn\tCúcheron is outside the Haunted Inn, in Audaghaim. You have done as Cúcheron asked and left the broken wooden toy at one of the gravestones in Audaghaim.\n",
[14245]="7001CC6F\n1\tDefeat Gorothúl in Sammath Gûl\tGorothúl can be found in Sammath Gûl, his chambers within the fortress of Dol Guldur. Bori has asked you to gather a fellowship of allies and to defeat the sorcerer Gorothúl in his chambers in Dol Guldur.\n2\tTalk to Bori in the Chamber of Leadership\tBori is in the Chamber of Leadership, located off the Twenty-first Hall, in Moria. You have defeated Gorothúl and should report the happy fact to Bori in Moria.\n",
[14246]="7001CC63\n1\tDefeat an Orc, goblin, or uruk in Mirkwood\030Defeat an Orc, goblin, or uruk in Lothlórien\030Defeat an Orc, goblin, or uruk in Moria\tYou are looking for Orcs, goblins, and uruks in Mirkwood, Lothlórien, and Moria. Lúth Greyhammer wants you to find and defeat a single Orc, goblin, or uruk in all the regions in which a Greyhammer has been wronged.\n2\tDefeat an Orc, goblin, or uruk in Eregion\030Defeat an Orc, goblin, or uruk in the Trollshaws\030Defeat an Orc, goblin, or uruk in the Misty Mountains\tYou are looking for Orcs, goblins, and uruks in Eregion, the Trollshaws, and the Misty Mountains. Lúth Greyhammer wants you to find and defeat a single Orc, goblin, or uruk in all the regions in which a Greyhammer has been wronged.\n3\tDefeat an Orc, goblin, or uruk in the Lone-lands\030Defeat an Orc, goblin, or uruk in Bree-land\030Defeat an Orc, goblin, or uruk in the North Downs\tYou are looking for Orcs, goblins, and uruks in the Lone-lands, Bree-land, and the North Downs. Lúth Greyhammer wants you to find and defeat a single Orc, goblin, or uruk in all the regions in which a Greyhammer has been wronged.\n4\tDefeat an Orc, goblin, or uruk in Evendim\030Defeat an Orc, goblin, or uruk in Forochel\030Defeat an Orc, goblin, or uruk in Angmar\tYou are looking for Orcs, goblins, and uruks in Evendim, Forochel, and Angmar. Lúth Greyhammer wants you to find and defeat a single Orc, goblin, or uruk in all the regions in which a Greyhammer has been wronged.\n5\tDefeat an Orc, goblin, or uruk in the Shire\030Defeat an Orc, goblin, or uruk in Ered Luin\tYou are looking for Orcs, goblins, and uruks in the Shire and Ered Luin. Lúth Greyhammer wants you to find and defeat a single Orc, goblin, or uruk in all the regions in which a Greyhammer has been wronged.\n6\tTalk to Tandri Greyhammer at Thorin's Hall\tTandri Greyhammer is in Thorin's Hall, in Ered Luin. Now that you have completed Lúth Greyhammer's glorious deed of sending a statement to the Orcs in every region where a Greyhammer was wronged, it is time to tell his father Tandri of your exploits.\n",
[14247]="7001CC85\n1\tBring Issuriel's elanor blossom to Bróin in the Peaceful Path\tBróin is in the Peaceful Path, located off Durin's Way, in Moria. Issuriel has given you a beautiful flower to give to Bróin as a token of her friendship and thankfulness.\n",
[14248]="7001CC5D\n1\tDefeat Orcs throughout Dol Guldur (total: 28)\030Find the entrance to the Warg-pens\030Find the entrance to the Sword-hall\030Find the entrance to the Dungeons\tOrcs can be found throughout Dol Guldur, as can the entrances to the Warg-pens, Sword-hall, and Dungeons of Dol Guldur. Laeglang has asked you to defeat Orcs throughout Dol Guldur and to scout the locations of various points of interest throughout the fortress.\n2\tTalk to Laeglang outside Dol Guldur\tLaeglang is outside the fortress of Dol Guldur. You have done as Laeglang asked and should return to the scout now in victory.\n",
[14249]="7001CC5E\n1\tDefeat worms within Gath Ulunn (total: 15)\030Defeat Orcs within Gath Ulunn (total: 5)\030Tip over odorous barrels (total: 3)\tWorms and Orcs can be found within Gath Ulunn, a cavern located among the Orc camps in the northern reaches of Gathbúrz. Ningloril has asked you to gather some allies and to defeat worms and Orcs within Gath Ulunn and to tip over any of the odorous barrels being used in the breeding of the worms.\n2\tTalk to Ningloril at Thangúlhad\tNingloril is in Thangúlhad, the camp of the Golden Host in Gathbúrz. You have hindered the worm breeding program in Gath Ulunn and should tell Ningloril about your success.\n",
[14250]="7001CC5F\n1\tTalk to a Galadhrim Guard outside the gates of Caras Galadhon and complete 'The Paths of Caras Galadhon'\tLord Celeborn is in the city of Caras Galadhon, in Lothlórien. Ellunen has asked you to deliver Sigileth's knives to Lord Celeborn, as that was her wish in life and is certain to be the same in death.\n2\tBring Sigileth's knives to Celeborn at the House of Celeborn\tLord Celeborn is at his house in Caras Galadhon, the Elf-city of Lothlórien. Ellunen has asked you to deliver Sigileth's knives to Lord Celeborn.\n",
[14251]="7001CC60\n1\tTalk to Bori in the Chamber of Leadership, in Moria\tBori is in the Chamber of Leadership, a small room located in the southern wall of the Twenty-first Hall, in Moria. Goldagnir has told you that Bori has returned to Moria and desires to speak with you when next you pass through the dwarf-kingdom.\n2\tTalk to Bori and aid him with the return of Zigilburk\tBori is in the Chamber of Leadership, located in the southern wall of the Twenty-first Hall, in Moria. Bori and Bróin have determined that the dwarves must not retain possession of Zigilburk and have decided to return the mithril axe to where it was found.\n3\tTalk to Bori in the Chamber of Leadership\tBori is in the Chamber of Leadership, located in the southern wall of the Twenty-first Hall, in Moria. Zigilburk has been returned to the watery chamber where it once lay hidden. You should speak now to Bori about the decision to abandon possession of the mithril axe.\n",
[14252]="7002093B\n1\tTalk to Pethelen and meet with Master Elrond\tPethelen is at the front porch of the Last Homely House, in Rivendell. The Elf Pethelen is eager to speak with you and travel together to see Master Elrond about some urgent matter.\n2\tTalk to Pethelen at the Last Homely House\tPethelen is at the front porch of the Last Homely House, in Rivendell. You have met with Master Elrond of Rivendell, and have been charged with an important task: the gathering of Aragorn's kin from all throughout Eriador, that they may come to his aid in the south.\n",
[14253]="7001C524\n1\tCollect relics of interest from merrevail (total: 10)\tMerrevail can be found in large numbers at Dannenglor, the ruins north of the Haunted Inn in the Dourstocks. You should collect treasure from the greedy morroval beasts that hoard it.\n2\tTalk to Mírdiniel at the Haunted Inn\tMírdiniel waits in the Haunted Inn, in the Dourstocks of Mirkwood, south of Dannenglor. You should bring Mírdiniel the plunder you wrested from the merrevail of Dannenglor so that she can examine it.\n",
[14254]="700033DD\n1\tTalk to Glamír at the Elf-ruins\tGlamír can be found at a small outpost north-east through the woods outside of Gondamon. He rests within a small Elf-ruin there. Glamír, an Elf, sought assistance from Áskell and the Dwarves of Gondamon before heading north-east towards a large encampment of Dourhand Dwarves. Áskell has asked you to seek him out and learn if he knows the whereabouts of Skíthi Blackhand.\n2\tDefeat Skíthi Blackhand\tSkíthi Blackhand is in the fortified eastern camp, north of Gondamon. Áskell has asked you to slay Skíthi Blackhand, the Dourhand leader, in revenge for his brother's murder.\n3\tTalk to Áskell at Gondamon\tÁskell is at Gondamon, south of the Dourhand-encampments. You should return to Áskell with news of your victory over Skíthi Blackhand.\n",
[14255]="7005A994\n1\tUncover the dwarf mirrors at Vâr Nuchur\tDwarf mirrors can be found at Vâr Nuchur in Máttugard. You should uncover the dwarf mirrors at Vâr Nuchur.\n2\tDwarf mirrors can be found at Vâr Nuchur in Máttugard. You should uncover the dwarf mirrors at Vâr Nuchur.\t\n3\tCompleted\tUncovered the dwarf mirrors at Vâr Nuchur.\n",
[14256]="70062D3D\n1\tCollect flowering rushes (total: 8)\tLindeth has asked you to bring her back any flowering rushes that you might find in Wadewater. Wadewater is in northern Swanfleet.\n2\tReturn to Lindeth\tYou should bring the flowering rushes to Lindeth. Lindeth is in Echad Terthas.\n",
[14257]="70022BA8\n1\tFind the source of the wailing in the Creeping Wing\tAn unearthly wailing sound can be heard in the Creeping Wing of the Haunted Burrow. You should seek out the source of the wailing and drive it off so that Polo can continue his search for treasure without troublesome interruptions.\n2\tReturn to Polo Puddifoot with news of the \"ghost\"\tPolo Puddifoot awaits you outside the Haunted Burrow. You should return to Polo Puddifoot and tell him of this \"ghost\" you encountered.\n",
[14258]="7004799A\n1\tDefeat Mordor war-trolls (total: 10)\tMordor war-trolls can be found within The Towers of the Teeth. You should defeat Mordor war-trolls.\n2\tReturn to Candúr\tYou should return to Candúr, who can be found at a small Ranger outpost hidden in the Slag-hills.\n",
[14259]="7004A8EF\n1\tLazy Orcs can be found throughout the Tower of Cirith Ungol in Lhingris. Captain Róglarg has asked you to wake up lazy Orcs in Cirith Ungol.\t\n2\tCompleted\tYou have awoken many of the lazy Orcs of Cirith Ungol and set them back to work.\n",
[14260]="7001BFC9\n1\tDefeat the Dead at Nan Dhelu (total: 8)\tNorth and east of Dol Vaeg are the ruins at Nan Dhelu. Cwendreda informed you to be wary as there are a good many of dangerous Dead within the ruins of Nan Dhelu and has asked you to banish them.\n2\tTalk to Cwendreda at Dol Vaeg\tCwendreda is at Dol Vaeg. The perils of Nan Dhelu are behind you now, but the memories will remain. The Dead overrun the ruins, and though there is a rich history in that place, an evil exists there also.\n",
[14261]="70046C53\n1\tUse your whistle to see if Shell is ready to walk\030Use the whistle to summon your new friend for a walk\tShell the dog sits next to Cranniel. You should see if the dog is ready for a walk.\n2\tWalk Shell along the Cape Road\030Use the whistle to summon your new friend if you become separated\tWalk Shell along Cape Road, which runs along the coast of the Cape of Belfalas.\n3\tContinue walking Shell along Cape Road\030Use the whistle to summon your new friend if you become separated\tWalk Shell along Cape Road, which runs along the coast of the Cape of Belfalas.\n4\tWalk further along Cape Road with Shell\030Use the whistle to summon your new friend if you become separated\tWalk Shell along Cape Road, which runs along the coast of the Cape of Belfalas.\n5\tKeep walking along Cape Road with Shell\030Use the whistle to summon your new friend if you become separated\tWalk Shell along Cape Road, which runs along the coast of the Cape of Belfalas.\n6\tMake your way back along Cape Road with Shell\030Use the whistle to summon your new friend if you become separated\tWalk Shell along Cape Road, which runs along the coast of the Cape of Belfalas.\n7\tKeep walking Shell back along Cape Road\030Use the whistle to summon your new friend if you become separated\tWalk Shell along Cape Road, which runs along the coast of the Cape of Belfalas.\n8\tContinue walking Shell back along Cape Road\030Use the whistle to summon your new friend if you become separated\tWalk Shell along Cape Road, which runs along the coast of the Cape of Belfalas.\n9\tTake Shell back to Cranniel\030Use the whistle to summon your new friend if you become separated\tWalk Shell along Cape Road, which runs along the coast of the Cape of Belfalas.\n10\tFinish your walk with Shell\030Use the whistle to summon your new friend if you become separated\tFinish your walk with Shell.\n11\tTalk to Cranniel\tCranniel is located near the lighthouse on the Cape of Belfalas. You should speak with Cranniel.\n",
[14262]="70068BB4\n1\tRun a circuit around the amphitheatre (0/3)\tKâsho suggested that you make several circuits around the amphitheatre.\n2\tRun a circuit around the amphitheatre (0/3)\tKâsho suggested that you make several circuits around the amphitheatre.\n3\tRun a circuit around the amphitheatre (0/3)\tKâsho suggested that you make several circuits around the amphitheatre.\n4\tRun a circuit around the amphitheatre (1/3)\tKâsho suggested that you make several circuits around the amphitheatre.\n5\tRun a circuit around the amphitheatre (1/3)\tKâsho suggested that you make several circuits around the amphitheatre.\n6\tRun a circuit around the amphitheatre (1/3)\tKâsho suggested that you make several circuits around the amphitheatre.\n7\tRun a circuit around the amphitheatre (2/3)\tKâsho suggested that you make several circuits around the amphitheatre.\n8\tRun a circuit around the amphitheatre (2/3)\tKâsho suggested that you make several circuits around the amphitheatre.\n9\tRun a circuit around the amphitheatre (2/3)\tKâsho suggested that you make several circuits around the amphitheatre.\n10\tTalk to Kâsho at the amphitheatre\tKâsho is at the amphitheatre outside the city.\n",
[14263]="7002BFC9\n1\tCollect turtle-egg\tTurtle-eggs may be found at the turtle nesting-grounds to the south-east of the Woodman camp in the Rushgore. Frogildi has asked you to collect the turtles' eggs and bring them to her.\n2\tBring the egg you collected to Frogildi at the Woodman-camp\tTurtle-eggs may be found at the turtle nesting-grounds to the south-east of the Woodman camp in the Rushgore. Frogildi has asked you to collect the turtles' eggs and bring them to her.\n3\tTalk to Frogildi at the Woodman camp in the Rushgore\tFrogildi is at the Woodman camp in the Rushgore, north-west of the turtle nesting-grounds. You should speak with Frogildi regarding the eggs.\n",
[14264]="70025B80\n1\tDefeat lake-skimmers on Tyl Ruinen (total: 12)\tLake-skimmers can be found around the shore of Tyl Ruinen. Lúgethir asked you to defeat lake-skimmers to prevent the salamanders from using them to get to shore.\n2\tTalk to Lúgethir on Tyl Ruinen\tLúgethir is at Humphrey's camp on Tyl Ruinen. Lúgethir will be pleased to hear that the lake-skimmers have been destroyed, though you fail to see how they could have carried any salamanders.\n",
[14265]="70030F08\n1\tSignal riders to the barricades (total: 5)\tThe barricades can be found along the road near the East Wall to the north and north-west of Walstow.\n2\tTalk to the guard-captain\tThe guard-captain of Walstow can be found at the north end of Walstow.\n",
[14266]="700571B2\n1\tGather brambles (total: 10)\tBrambles can be found in the Floodfells. You should gather brambles for Limlók.\n2\tFortify Limlók with brambles (total: 10)\tBrambles should be placed around Limlók.\n",
[14267]="70009EF8\n1\tDefeat the Free Peoples at Lugazag (total: 6)\tDefeat the enemy within the walls of Lugazag. The enemy will fall as they crash against the walls, provided you stand against them as they attempt to crash the walls.\n2\tTalk to Soldier Gazlup\030Talk to War-tyrant Akúlhun\tSoldier Gazlup is at Lugazag. If the tower was lost to the enemy or Soldier Gazlup was beaten during the fighting, make your way to Gramsfoot and speak with War-tyrant Akúlhun. You should return to Gazlup and report of your victory.\n",
[14268]="7003E286\n1\tDefeat cruel-beaks near Trestlebridge (total: 10)\tCruel-beaks can be found in and around the Tarkrîp Orc encampments north of Trestlebridge. You should defeat a number of these cruel crebain.\n2\tCompleted\tYou have defeated a number of the invading crebain.\n",
[14269]="7000B989\n1\tDefeat Stone-trolls in Tâl Bruinen (total: 4)\tStone-trolls sometimes wander out of the north into Tâl Bruinen by night. The hunter Cerys has asked you to defeat the Stone-trolls that come into Tâl Bruinen at night.\n2\tTalk to Cerys\tCerys is at Echad Candelleth, the Elf-camp in Tâl Bruinen. You have defeated a number of wandering Stone-trolls and should report of your victory to Cerys.\n",
[14270]="70007808\n1\tTalk to Eldo Swatmidge at his farm\tEldo Swatmidge's farm is up the road to the north and east of the Widow Froghorn's farm. Asphodel Froghorn stated she would allow Eldo to court her, if he was willing to sell his dog. You should return to Eldo Swatmidge with the widow's terms.\n2\tTalk to Asphodel Froghorn at her farm\tThe Widow Froghorn's farm is on the road west and south of Eldo Swatmidge's farm. Eldo Swatmidge cannot sell Wanetta even though he cares so much for Asphodel Froghorn. He has asked you to deliver his message to the Widow.\n3\tTalk to Eldo Swatmidge at his farm\tEldo Swatmidge's farm is up the road north and east of the Widow Froghorn's farm. Asphodel Froghorn found Eldo's loyalty so endearing that she is willing to put up with sniffles and sneezing. You should return to Eldo Swatmidge with the good news.\n",
[14271]="70050C20\n1\tCollect crafter's lead\030Collect delver's plaster\030Collect dragon-stone\tThe Zhélruka Dwarf Mózhek has asked you to gather crafter's lead, delver's plaster, and dragon-stone while assisting his people in the Grey Mountains. These items may be found by defeating foes in Grey Mountains endgame instances. Different instances will yield different types of items!\n2\tReturn to Mózhek\tYou should deliver the items you collected to Mózhek in Skarháld.\n",
[14272]="7005161A\n1\tCollect crafter's lead\030Collect delver's plaster\030Collect scrub-moss\tThe Zhélruka Dwarf Mózhek has asked you to gather crafter's lead, delver's plaster, and scrub-moss while assisting his people in the Grey Mountains. These items may be found by defeating foes in Grey Mountains endgame instances. Different instances will yield different types of items!\n2\tReturn to Mózhek\tYou should deliver the items you collected to Mózhek in Skarháld.\n",
})
